<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">23042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Russia will halt Kazakh crude shipments to Germany on the first of May, closing the last loophole in four years of sanctions.</s> <s>The Schwedt refinery supplies ninety percent of Berlin's fuel, and Germany had negotiated the Kazakh route precisely as its post-sanctions bypass.</s> <s>Moscow is shutting that door just as Hormuz disruption tightens the global oil market.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's two largest states opened simultaneous assembly elections on Thursday, with one hundred fifty-two constituencies voting across Tamil Nadu and West Bengal.</s> <s>Twelve seats in Bengal's first phase were decided by margins under one percent last cycle, and together these states hold two hundred seventy-three seats — enough to set the tone for Modi's twenty-twenty-eight federal calculus.</s> <s>The Bharatiya Janata Party is fighting Trinamool in Bengal and backing an opposition alliance in Tamil Nadu.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel bombed a shelter in Tyre where Lebanese journalist Amal Khalil had taken cover, then struck the house again one hundred two minutes later and shot at the Red Cross vehicle reaching her colleague.</s> <s>The Committee to Protect Journalists called it a grave breach of international humanitarian law.</s> <s>Press killings in south Lebanon are no longer collateral... they're policy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Judicial Commission meets on the twenty-eighth of April to recommend the forced transfer of five Islamabad High Court judges to provincial benches.</s> <s>The twenty-seventh constitutional amendment stripped judges of the right to refuse, letting the commission rotate inconvenient courts without overturning their rulings.</s> <s>Judges who refuse face removal proceedings.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France lost a second peacekeeper to a deliberate strike on UN Interim Force in Lebanon positions, and President Macron has blamed Hezbollah directly — the first such accusation from a NATO state.</s> <s>The April eighteenth attack killed two French soldiers in southern Lebanon.</s> <s>Paris must renew its seven-hundred-troop mission mandate by August.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudan's military has executed nine Nuba detainees since January, and the Nuba Mountains Observatory has now documented two hundred twenty-eight civilians held in Kadugli custody — men, women, and children.</s> <s>No international body has access to the sites.</s> <s>The Observatory is expanding its documentation alone, because nobody else is watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Islamic State fighters killed eleven villagers in Pubagu, the third attack on Askira Uba communities this month, and Nigeria's national emergency agency was unaware the strike had even occurred.</s> <s>Residents face displacement with no state support.</s> <s>No government agency beyond the local council has reached the area.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nepal's Home Minister Sudhan Gurung resigned over alleged ties to a money-laundering suspect, the second cabinet departure in four weeks under the country's new anti-corruption government.</s> <s>Prime Minister Balendra Shah now holds the portfolio himself pending a replacement.</s> <s>The government that promised to clean house is losing ministers faster than it can vet them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran rejected a United States demand to formally renounce nuclear weapons during talks Pakistan hosted on the eleventh and twelfth of April, and Islamabad's mediation effort collapsed.</s> <s>Washington has given Tehran three to five days to submit a unified counter-proposal before Vice President talks resume.</s> <s>The clock is now measured in days, not weeks.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon told American lawmakers that clearing Iranian mines from the Strait of Hormuz could take six months, even after a ceasefire.</s> <s>Roughly twenty percent of global crude flows through the strait, and Treasury Secretary Bessent warned gasoline prices could stay above three dollars until late September.</s> <s>The cost of this war is now baked into shipping insurance for the rest of the year.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ninety thousand Samsung workers rallied at the Pyeongtaek plant on Thursday, with the union threatening a strike unless the company reaches a deal by the twenty-first of May.</s> <s>Samsung historically crushed unions, but membership tripled after rival SK Hynix conceded bonus reforms in twenty-twenty-four, exposing Samsung's pay gap.</s> <s>South Korea's chaebol model is bending where it once would not move.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A four-day security lockdown around Rawalpindi has paralyzed Islamabad's supply chain, blocking oil tankers and emptying wholesale food markets, with both airports' fuel supplies now at risk.</s> <s>The Punjab government holds the authorization for the closures.</s> <s>When the state shuts roads to manage protest, traders bear the cost long before protesters do.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney rejected a Washington demand for an entry fee before USMCA renegotiation talks can begin.</s> <s>The treaty's six-year joint-review clause was designed as a procedural check, but turning it into a pay-to-play tribute resets the baseline for every other trade partner.</s> <s>Canada faces a first of July negotiating deadline with no formal talks scheduled.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Donald Trump offered Spirit Airlines a five-hundred-million-dollar federal rescue, with the United States taking option warrants on ninety percent of the twice-bankrupt carrier.</s> <s>JPMorgan warned that JetBlue and Frontier would now seek the same terms.</s> <s>Transportation Secretary Duffy himself called it good money after bad.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A strong El Niño is expected by autumn, putting twenty-twenty-six on track to be the second-warmest year ever recorded, behind only twenty-twenty-four.</s> <s>The first quarter was cooled by a brief La Niña, but the climate signal is now flipping from cooling to warming within months.</s> <s>For readers in South Asia and the Sahel, this is not abstract... it's the next monsoon.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mathematicians at a New York institute have built a new invariant that resolves knot pairs unsolvable for decades by Khovanov homology, the field's existing benchmark.</s> <s>Knot classification feeds quantum field theory and DNA topology, where distinguishing equivalent-looking loops decides the physics.</s> <s>The tool is being called a QR code for tangled mathematics.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Penn State physicists have closed a twenty-year Standard Model anomaly, recalculating hadronic vacuum polarization to bring theory and the muon experiment within half a sigma.</s> <s>The result constrains, but doesn't eliminate, the regions where physics beyond the Standard Model might still hide.</s> <s>One door closes, several others narrow.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A San Francisco tool called Malus uses large language models to perform clean-room reimplementations of open-source code, stripping GPL, MIT, and Apache licences while legally avoiding copyright infringement.</s> <s>Copyright protects expression, not ideas, so machine-laundered code exits the copyleft regime intact.</s> <s>That breaks the enforcement model that has protected Linux, Git, and most of the software supply chain for thirty years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Microsoft pledged twenty-five billion Australian dollars for AI infrastructure in Australia, its largest single-country commitment outside the United States.</s> <s>The deal includes training three million Australians in AI skills by twenty-twenty-eight and a major Azure GPU expansion.</s> <s>Hyperscaler geography is being redrawn around regulatory permissiveness, and Canberra is the new beneficiary.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A North Korean state group drained up to twelve million dollars from personal cryptocurrency accounts in the first quarter using infostealer malware, according to Recorded Future.</s> <s>The campaign hit individual phones rather than exchanges, bypassing platform-level security entirely.</s> <s>Pyongyang has shifted its theft from the vault to the pocket.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Lebanese mobile money service called Whish, the country's de facto bank since the twenty-nineteen collapse, is now under attack by fraud rings impersonating its agents on WhatsApp.</s> <s>Lebanon has no deposit insurance and no fraud regulator, leaving victims with no recovery path.</s> <s>The substitute for a broken banking system is itself unprotected.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>